    <title>The AI Chatbot Drag Race</title>

    <link>https://dragracewithai.netlify.app/</link>

    <description><![CDATA[
      “The AI Chatbot Drag Race” is an immersive, experimental podcast in which six AI chatbots enter a drag race competition modeled after RuPaul’s Drag Race. The chatbots bring humor, spiciness, and a sharp tongue, and the unique aspect of the podcast is that their outputs are performed by a single human actor, who follows the persona clues from the chatbots. Through comedy, performance, and insightful discourse, the podcast explores the behavior of AI chatbots, their persona trajectories, and the implications for Responsible AI.
    ]]></description>

